# The one fatal error a plant built by 0.19.0 or earlier reports: its silo face is the retired
# plumbing frontage, which conflicts with the point-of-use layout cell for cell. %s = the tier
# measured off the standing walls.
beyondthestars.structure.silo.standing=Tier %s Steam Generator IS STANDING and does not match the current silo face — the first wrong cell is listed above. A plant raised by 0.19.0 or earlier has the retired face: stand beside the main station and run /btsmigrate to rewrite it in place.
beyondthestars.gui.throttle.tooltip=Control rods: campaign power = N/24. A programmed circuit in the controller overrides this.
beyondthestars.gui.buildtier.tooltip=Build Tier: the Steam Generator tier the hologram/projector builds (1-5). A trigger stack of 2-5 overrides this. A silo that already stands is never re-tiered - dismantle it first.

